Data notice: this license covers the source code only. The files under
data/fire/ are a 28-pair test subset of the FIRE dataset (Fundus Image
Registration Dataset), which is the property of its original authors and is
redistributed here solely for reproducibility of the test split. Any use of
the FIRE data requires citation of:

  C. Hernandez-Matas, X. Zabulis, A. Triantafyllou, P. Anyfanti, S. Douma,
  A.A. Argyros, "FIRE: Fundus Image Registration Dataset", Journal for
  Modeling in Ophthalmology, vol. 1, no. 4, pp. 16-28, 2017.
  DOI: 10.35119/maio.v1i4.42

Full dataset and terms: https://projects.ics.forth.gr/cvrl/fire/
